ce", "01": "generate", "10": "develop", "11": "craft"}}, {"a": {"0": "a", "1": "a"}}, {"more": {"0": "more", "1": "more"}}, {"sustainable": {"00": "viable", "01": "renewable", "10": "maintainable", "11": "eco-friendly"}}, {"and": {"0": "and", "1": "and"}}, {"just": {"0": "equitable", "1": "fair"}}, {"future": {"0": "prospects", "1": "outlook"}}], "container": "Ethical consumption is a growing trend that has a significant influence on individuals and society as a whole. It refers to making conscious choices as consumers to support products and services that align with our values and moral beliefs. One of the key influences of ethical consumption is the impact it has on the environment. By opting for products that are sustainably sourced and produced, consumers actively participate in reducing their carbon footprint and preserving natural resources. This, in turn, encourages companies to adopt more eco-friendly practices in order to meet the growing demand for ethically produced goods. Another important influence of ethical consumption is the improvement it brings to labor conditions. This involves supporting companies that provide fair wages, safe working conditions, and prohibit child labor. By doing so, consumers contribute to the well-being of workers and help combat exploitation in the global supply chain. Ethical consumption also has an economic impact by encouraging the growth of ethical businesses. As more consumers prioritize ethical values, companies that prioritize social and environmental responsibility have a competitive advantage. This stimulates innovation and encourages other businesses to adopt ethical practices in order to remain relevant in the market. In conclusion, ethical consumption is a powerful force that influences both individuals and society at large. By making conscious choices, consumers can contribute to a healthier environment, improved labor conditions, and the growth of ethical businesses. It is essential that we continue to prioritize ethical consumption in order to create a more sustainable and just future.", "encoded_message": "Principled utilization is a escalating shift that has a substantial sway on individuals and society as a aggregate. It relates to Making aware options as buyers to back commodities and services that match with our values and virtuous convictions. One of the central motivations of honorable consumption is the impact it has on the environment. By electing for goods that are ecologically procured and generated, buyers energetically engage in diminishing their carbon footprint and conserving natural supplies. This, in turn, stimulates corporations to implement more green tactics in order to satisfy the growing demand for honorably crafted goods. Another important sway concerning principled ingestion is the amendment it provokes to employment situations. This requires backing corporations that offer just earnings, sheltered laboring terms, and prevent minor work. By carrying out so, clients add to the welfare of laborers and support challenge exploitation in the global supply chain. Ethical consumption also has an economic impact by encouraging the growth of ethical businesses. As more consumers prioritize ethical values, companies that prioritize social and environmental responsibility have a competitive advantage. This stimulates innovation and encourages other businesses to adopt ethical practices in order to remain relevant in the market. In conclusion, ethical consumption is a powerful force that influences both individuals and society at large. By making conscious choices, consumers can contribute to a healthier environment, improved labor conditions, and the growth of ethical businesses. It is essential that we continue to prioritize ethical consumption in order to create a more sustainable and just future.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 21.66, "secret_key_generation": 67.08}, "decoding_time": 0.0008411407470703125, "decoded_message": "10110101010